 "_controlZone": "The ring the match is fought inside, drawn on every map. Centre and radius were measured off metaforge.app, which draws the real zones, by pixel against tower coordinates whose game X/Y are known: three Bakurani zones came back 500, 515 and 512 m and Ozeti about 550, so 500 m is the figure and radiusConfirmed is false until somebody reads it in game. Note it is NOT the map centre. It sits on the tower cluster. Press material says the control zone is 2x2 km, which does not match anything drawn on either map, so it is not used here."
